Description: Logitech BRIO controls for Linux (HDR, FOV, zoom, profiles)
 GTK4/libadwaita app plus a user daemon (briod) that apply every setting
 Logitech G HUB offers for the BRIO webcam, including HDR, the 90/78/65 degree
 field of view, presets and per-app profiles.
